      "writtenOn": "2024-11-22T13:12:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That client can also keep the `NotImplemented` classes in its own source code. And it can also automate generating them. I don\u0027t see why all Gerrit developers should care to continuously support an implementation pattern from a client.",
      "parentUuid": "07e42a67_cd3ce0e3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 72
