      "writtenOn": "2024-11-22T13:19:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not against dropping these classes, but the commit message should reflect what was their purpose and what we are suggesting instead.\n\n\u003e I don\u0027t see why all Gerrit developers should care to continuously support an implementation pattern from a client.\n\nWell, I guess it would make sense if there would be many such clients.",
