      "writtenOn": "2024-11-22T13:40:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, I can add a discussion and justification in the commit message.\n\n\u003e Well, I guess it would make sense if there would be many such clients.\n\nIf this would be our intention then I would suggest that we automate generation of the `NotImplemented` classes when building a \"gerrit-api\" library to be used by the clients. We should be able to do better than manually maintain that boilerplate code.",
